            <p class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Check these three first</p>
            <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed m-0">Space: several hundred cubic feet of air, or louvered doors or ducting. Power: a 240-volt circuit, or a 120-volt plug-in model instead. Drainage: a floor drain, sink or condensate pump within reach. Miss any one and the installation gets expensive.</p>
          </div>
