            The Rheem ProTerra 50-gallon hybrid is the one to buy for most homes with a basement or garage and a 240-volt circuit. Larger households should move up to the 66-gallon A.O. Smith Voltex AL, homes with a full electrical panel should look at the Rheem ProTerra Plug-In, and cold-climate homes with no good indoor location should consider the SanCO2 split system despite its cost.
